#### P1.4: Application Lifecycle
**Effort**: HIGH (12-16 units)
**Dependencies**: P1.1 (build system)

**Description**:
Create LibGDX ApplicationListener implementation as alternative to PApplet. Support both windowed and headless modes.

**Acceptance Criteria**:
- [ ] `TesseractLibGDXMain.java` created implementing ApplicationListener
- [ ] create() method mirrors setup() logic
- [ ] render() method mirrors draw() logic (without rendering)
- [ ] Headless mode detection working
- [ ] Configuration loading functional
- [ ] WebSocket server initializes
- [ ] All business logic executes without rendering
- [ ] Unit tests for headless mode

**Technical Notes**:
```java
public class TesseractLibGDXMain implements ApplicationListener {
    private boolean headless;
    private TesseractRenderer renderer;
    private UDPModel udpModel;
    private Stage stage;
    private Channel channel1;

    @Override
    public void create() {
        // Mirror TesseractMain.setup() logic
        headless = Gdx.app.getType() == Application.ApplicationType.HeadlessDesktop;

        if (!headless) {
            renderer = new TesseractRenderer();
        }

        // Rest of initialization...
    }

    @Override
    public void render() {
        // Mirror TesseractMain.draw() logic
        channel1.run();

        // Compute node colors...

        if (!headless && renderer != null) {
            renderer.render(stage.nodes);
        }

        udpModel.send();
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        boolean headless = System.getProperty("headless") != null;

        if (headless) {
            HeadlessApplicationConfiguration config = new HeadlessApplicationConfiguration();
            new HeadlessApplication(new TesseractLibGDXMain(), config);
        } else {
            LwjglApplicationConfiguration config = new LwjglApplicationConfiguration();
            config.width = 1400;
            config.height = 800;
            config.title = "Tesseract LED Visualizer";
            new LwjglApplication(new TesseractLibGDXMain(), config);
        }
    }
}
```

**File**: New `src/main/app/TesseractLibGDXMain.java`

