**Technical Notes**:
```java
public class TesseractInputProcessor implements InputProcessor {
    private TesseractLibGDXMain app;
    private TesseractRenderer renderer;

    @Override
    public boolean touchDown(int screenX, int screenY, int pointer, int button) {
        if (renderer != null) {
            renderer.handleMousePressed(screenX, screenY);
        }
        return true;
    }

    @Override
    public boolean keyDown(int keycode) {
        if (keycode == Input.Keys.S) {
            app.toggleSending();
        } else if (keycode == Input.Keys.D) {
            app.toggleDrawing();
        }
        return true;
    }

    // ... other InputProcessor methods
}
```

**File**: New `src/main/app/TesseractInputProcessor.java`

